## 9. Summary

The repository provides a useful **mentor-guided embedded-systems internship example** of STM32 ADC acquisition, polling-based UART, Modbus RTU-style communication with CRC16, and a Qt/C++ desktop interface. The documented limitations are part of the existing snapshot and have **not been patched** during this documentation review.
